  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This task is to ensure that \"omitting\" server-managed triples (SMT) behaves as expected under the following circumstances:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "1) Create an RDF Source with client-provided triples, then request that resource (omitting SMTs) and ensure that only the client-provided triples are in the response.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "2) Add an rdf:type to the RDF Source, and ensure that it is included in the response that omits SMTs.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "3) Ensure server-managed triples can not be updated (i.e. repository namespace).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Note: To omit server-managed triples on GET requests, include the following request header:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "type": "rule"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Prefer: return=representation; omit=\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#ServerManaged"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#ServerManaged",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "type": "rule"
    }
   ],
